			"notes": "## v1.2.2\n\n### Fixed\n- The Ping-Wheel hook can no longer stop the game from launching. Ping-Wheel has no public API, so this addon injects into it; if that method ever changes, the injection now fails quietly and the integration turns itself off instead of halting startup.\n- JourneyMap waypoints are now created on the main thread rather than the network thread.\n\n### Changed\n- The homepage and the bug-report link shown in the mod list now point at the CurseForge page.\n- All builds are on the same version number again. Forge and NeoForge 1.21.1 sat at 1.1.0 because the 1.2.0 and 1.2.1 releases had nothing for them."
		},
